{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/SD40_With_Wrecking_Ball_600.gif?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast through the zombie apocalypse in this top-down action roguelite! Take control of a deadly train, aim your primary weapon, gather resources with drone support, rescue survivors, and upgrade your firepower strategically. Unlock new locomotives, powerful weapons, and terrifying bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choo Choo Survivor 2 blends horde survival and strategic upgrades in a unique experience inspired by games like <i>Vampire Survivors</i> and <i>Dome Keeper</i>, while carving out its own intense, locomotive-driven gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/DRB_With_Blaster_Short_Clip_Type_2_600px.gif?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Your primary weapon is independent of the locomotive choice, so you can pick the perfect tool to crush or melt the zombie horde! Each locomotive comes with a unique auxiliary system, and you can add more during a run, allowing for a wide variety of powerful and strategic builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/Chain_saw_upgrades.jpg?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On each journey, you\u2019ll encounter the optional Relic Keeper boss\u2014defeat it to unlock an extra auxiliary system. Plus, visit the shop to buy an additional auxiliary system, stock up on resources, and hire survivors to strengthen your train!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/Almost_defeating_the_relic_keeper.jpg?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The environment is fully destructible! Level buildings to reduce zombie spawns and clear your path to victory! Your main resources are gold, steel, and survivors, all crucial for upgrading your train. Gold can be found in crates and buildings like tombs, cabins, supermarkets, and police stations. Steel comes from metal objects such as cars, camper vans, and reinforced structures. Survivors are hidden in safe houses, and their numbers vary with each run, making every playthrough unpredictable and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/Flames_shurikens_and_Upgradeable_Cow_Catcher.jpg?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run offers a fresh experience with procedurally generated tracks. Choose from one of three unique journeys at the start. Go slow and steady, gather resources, upgrade your train, and prepare for escalating waves of zombies. Defeat the boss and reach the journey\u2019s end to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/Zombie_horde_at_track_end.jpg?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your experience with multiple color schemes! Choose your favorite in the Settings menu. Adjust resolution, rebind keys, and 5120\u00d71440 ultra-wide monitors are supported. One handed play is supported through the Accessibility menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/Custodian_in_the_mines.jpg?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At launch, the full game will feature five unique bosses, ten unlockable locomotives, ten primary weapons, and over ten auxiliary systems\u2014offering deep variety in train configurations and upgrade paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Choo Choo Survivor 2 free right now with the Steam Playtest! Enjoy full access while it's in development \u2014 it\u2019ll stay free until the official Steam launch. Hop aboard and start surviving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/a756df426cecdf2965945643e47bd200.poster.webp?t=1752878969\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/a756df426cecdf2965945643e47bd200.webp?t=1752878969\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3494210?t=1752878969","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3494210?t=1752878969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/5ec6538fdd30b716096200aa34748490fa96d2b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752878969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/5ec6538fdd30b716096200aa34748490fa96d2b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752878969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The player shoots down vast hordes of zombies."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/SD40_With_Wrecking_Ball_600.gif?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast through the zombie apocalypse in this top-down action roguelite! Take control of a deadly train, aim your primary weapon, gather resources with drone support, rescue survivors, and upgrade your firepower strategically. Unlock new locomotives, powerful weapons, and terrifying bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choo Choo Survivor 2 blends horde survival and strategic upgrades in a unique experience inspired by games like <i>Vampire Survivors</i> and <i>Dome Keeper</i>, while carving out its own intense, locomotive-driven gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/DRB_With_Blaster_Short_Clip_Type_2_600px.gif?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Your primary weapon is independent of the locomotive choice, so you can pick the perfect tool to crush or melt the zombie horde! Each locomotive comes with a unique auxiliary system, and you can add more during a run, allowing for a wide variety of powerful and strategic builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/Chain_saw_upgrades.jpg?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On each journey, you\u2019ll encounter the optional Relic Keeper boss\u2014defeat it to unlock an extra auxiliary system. Plus, visit the shop to buy an additional auxiliary system, stock up on resources, and hire survivors to strengthen your train!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/Almost_defeating_the_relic_keeper.jpg?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The environment is fully destructible! Level buildings to reduce zombie spawns and clear your path to victory! Your main resources are gold, steel, and survivors, all crucial for upgrading your train. Gold can be found in crates and buildings like tombs, cabins, supermarkets, and police stations. Steel comes from metal objects such as cars, camper vans, and reinforced structures. Survivors are hidden in safe houses, and their numbers vary with each run, making every playthrough unpredictable and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/Flames_shurikens_and_Upgradeable_Cow_Catcher.jpg?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run offers a fresh experience with procedurally generated tracks. Choose from one of three unique journeys at the start. Go slow and steady, gather resources, upgrade your train, and prepare for escalating waves of zombies. Defeat the boss and reach the journey\u2019s end to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/Zombie_horde_at_track_end.jpg?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your experience with multiple color schemes! Choose your favorite in the Settings menu. Adjust resolution, rebind keys, and 5120\u00d71440 ultra-wide monitors are supported. One handed play is supported through the Accessibility menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/Custodian_in_the_mines.jpg?t=1752878969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At launch, the full game will feature five unique bosses, ten unlockable locomotives, ten primary weapons, and over ten auxiliary systems\u2014offering deep variety in train configurations and upgrade paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Choo Choo Survivor 2 free right now with the Steam Playtest! Enjoy full access while it's in development \u2014 it\u2019ll stay free until the official Steam launch. Hop aboard and start surviving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/a756df426cecdf2965945643e47bd200.poster.webp?t=1752878969\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/extras/a756df426cecdf2965945643e47bd200.webp?t=1752878969\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","developers":["GTGD"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494210/69d45d657826635dc63d9da0f05ca11940cf6671/header.jpg?t=1752878969","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098011,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098011/movie480.mp4?t=1739864122","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098011/movie_max.mp4?t=1739864122"},"name":"Choo Choo Survivor 2 Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098011/d1622de962d954b1227d4ac4c9015cad3f5363a9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739864122","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098011/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739864122","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098011/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739864122"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257127826,"mp4":{"480":"http